Version 0.3.0
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Released: 2025-11-30

Bugfixes:
 * Background recordings show 00:00 and 0 bytes (GitHub: BLumia/pineapple-steam-recording-exporter#1)

Miscellaneous:
 * Tweak preview and thumbnail size
 * Introduce QVdfParser for better Vdf parsing
 * Update translations

Contributors:
 Atalanttore, Dirk, Vistaus, Trent McPheron

Version 0.2.0
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Released: 2025-10-12

Features:
 * Ensure having icons under SteamOS game mode
 * Add a Quit button for running in game mode
 * Local HTTP server for sharing exported videos now support preview as well
 * Update translations

Contributors:
 Vistaus

Version 0.1.0
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Released: 2025-10-06

Note:
 Initial release with core functionality

Features:
 * Steam recording detection and export
